  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "The snowman maiden, whose soul has entered a human body, Seolha! However, her body melts when it becomes hot. Her first love has endured for no less than a hundred years.\n\nThere is only one way for Seolha to become human—she must succeed in love?!\n\nHowever, unlike in her affectionate past life, Yiram doesn't understand Seolha's feelings. Even the god, Woojo, who used to argue every day, is showing an attitude quite different from before.\n\nWill Seolha be able to safely find success in love?!"
  },
